{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53110","headline":"偈 · 希迁","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从来共住不知名，任运相将作（《五灯会元》作「只」）摩行。\n自古上贤犹不识，造次常（《五灯会元》作「凡」）流岂可明。\n（见《祖堂集》卷四、《五灯会元》卷五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"希迁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}